Description: css: Read depth and inset box shadows
 .
 depth takes sunk, screen and popped, or a percentage or number from -100%
 (-1.0) to 100% (1.0). A value outside that range is ignored with a
 warning instead of being cut to the limit, as CSS Values 4 §5.1 makes
 such a declaration invalid. box-shadow takes the inset keyword first or
 last (CSS Backgrounds 3 §6.1).
 .
 TestCss now also loads small styles through CssLoader, with the default
 rules from the source tree, so the generated property syntax is part of
 what it checks.
